  "; every copy stays in sync.": "; ogni copia rimane in sincronia.",
  "<h2 class=\"on-md-heading-1\">What’s new in 4.93</h2>\n<p>Boards now <strong>sync across devices</strong> in a few seconds, and the canvas keeps its place when you switch spaces.</p>\n<ul><li>Press <code><span class=\"on-code-word\">⌘</span> <span class=\"on-code-word\">K</span></code> to jump to any board</li><li>Export to PDF with page breaks you choose</li></ul>\n<h3 class=\"on-md-heading-2\">Fixes</h3>\n<ol><li>Large boards no longer stutter while zooming</li><li>Comments keep their order after an undo</li></ol>\n<pre><code>orbitfold export --format pdf --pages 1-4</code></pre>\n<blockquote>Patch release: no separate notes.</blockquote>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th class=\"on-md-right\">Size</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>arm64</td><td class=\"on-md-right\">142 MB</td></tr><tr><td>x86-64</td><td class=\"on-md-right\">151 MB</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"#markdown\">Read the full changelog</a></p>": "<h2 class=\"on-md-heading-1\">Cosa c’è di nuovo in 4.93</h2>\n<p>Borse ora <strong>sincronizzazione tra i dispositivi</strong> in pochi secondi, e la tela mantiene il suo posto quando si passano gli spazi.</p>\n<ul><li>Rassegna <code><span class=\"on-code-word\">⌘</span> <span class=\"on-code-word\">K</span></code> per saltare a qualsiasi bordo</li><li>Esporta in PDF con interruzioni di pagina che scegli</li></ul>\n<h3 class=\"on-md-heading-2\">Fissazioni</h3>\n<ol><li>Le grandi tavole non sono più robuste durante lo zoom</li><li>Osservazioni mantenere il loro ordine dopo un disordine</li></ol>\n<pre><code>orbitfold export --format pdf --pages 1-4</code></pre>\n<blockquote>Rilascio di patch: nessuna nota separata.</blockquote>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Piattaforma</th><th class=\"on-md-right\">Dimensione</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>braccioli</td><td class=\"on-md-right\">142 MB</td></tr><tr><td>x86-64</td><td class=\"on-md-right\">151 MB</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"#markdown\">Leggi il changelog completo</a></p>",
